  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 707(b)(1), losses on sales or exchanges of property between a partnership and a person owning, directly or indirectly, more than 50% of the capital or profits interest are disallowed. Since the partner owns 55%, exceeding the 50% threshold, the loss is completely disallowed.
