  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 250(a)(1)(B), the GILTI deduction for C corporations drops from 50% to 37.5% for tax years beginning after December 31, 2025. This scheduled reduction was enacted as part of the original TCJA. Applied to the 21% corporate rate, a 37.5% deduction yields an effective GILTI tax rate of approximately 13.125%.
